Today is Thursday.
It is half past five in the evening.
I arrive at a local badminton club.
I like to play badminton very much.
Therefore, now I want to come here every Thursday.
The club is very big on the inside.
There is very good lighting here.
I look at the wooden indoor courts.
People are playing on every court.
A very fast game is going on at one court.
I watch that game.
Both players can play very well.
I also like to play fast like this.
I can also run fast on the court.
Watching this game, I am very excited.
I also want to play a good match today.
But I do not have my own racket.
So, I go towards the reception.
